yle=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.stdin.isTTY),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 如果检测到 package.json，推断语言为 Node.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    language: options.language </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detectProjectLanguage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 输出格式：管道中自动 JSON，终端中人类格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    format: options.format </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (process.stdout.isTTY </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'human'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"进度反馈设计\">进度反馈设计</h3><p>长时间操作必须提供进度反馈，但方式要恰当：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# TTY 环境：动态进度条&#10;$ tool build&#10;Building... ████████████████░░░░ 78% (312/400 files)&#10;&#10;# 管道/CI 环境：简洁的里程碑输出&#10;$ tool build 2&gt;&amp;1&#10;[1/4] Resolving dependencies...&#10;[2/4] Compiling source files...&#10;[3/4] Running post-build checks...&#10;[4/4] Build complete (4.2s)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># TTY 环境：动态进度条</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Building...</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ████████████████░░░░</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 78%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (312/400 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">files</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 管道/CI 环境：简洁的里程碑输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[1/4] Resolving dependencies...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[2/4] Compiling source files...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[3/4] Running post-build checks...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[4/4] Build complete (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">4.2s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>确定性进度用进度条（知道总量）</li>\n<li>不确定进度用 spinner（不知道何时结束）</li>\n<li>完成时显示耗时（便于性能追踪）</li>\n<li>stderr 输出进度信息，不影响 stdout 的数据流</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"确认步骤的设计\">确认步骤的设计</h3><p>危险操作需要确认，但不能过度确认：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 原则：默认安全，--force 跳过确认&#10;$ tool delete-all&#10;This will permanently delete 47 items. This cannot be undone.&#10;Continue? [y/N]&#10;&#10;# 脚本中使用 --force 或 --yes 跳过&#10;$ tool delete-all --yes&#10;&#10;# 提供 --dry-run 预览&#10;$ tool delete-all --dry-run&#10;Would delete:&#10;  - item-1 (created 2024-01-15)&#10;  - item-2 (created 2024-03-22)&#10;  ... (45 more)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 原则：默认安全，--force 跳过确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delete-all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">This</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> will</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> permanently</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delete</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 47</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> items.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> This</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cannot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> be</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undone.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Continue?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [y/N]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 脚本中使用 --force 或 --yes 跳过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delete-all</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --yes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 提供 --dry-run 预览</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delete-all</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Would</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delete:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> item-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (created </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2024-01-15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> item-2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (created </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2024-03-22</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (45 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">more</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自动补全\">自动补全</h3><p>现代 CLI 工具应该提供 shell 自动补全：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成补全脚本&#10;tool --completions bash &gt; /etc/bash_completion.d/tool&#10;tool --completions zsh &gt; ~/.zfunc/_tool&#10;tool --completions fish &gt; ~/.config/fish/completions/tool.fish\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成补全脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --completions</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/bash_completion.d/tool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --completions</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.zfunc/_tool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --completions</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fish</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.config/fish/completions/tool.fish</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动补全极大提升效率——用户不需要记住所有子命令和选项名，Tab 就能发现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一致性胜过完美\">一致性胜过完美</h3><p>如果你有多个工具或一个有多个子命令的工具，一致性比任何单个设计决策都重要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有子命令使用相同的 flag 名（<code>--json</code>, <code>--verbose</code>, <code>--quiet</code>）</li>\n<li>错误信息格式统一</li>\n<li>颜色含义一致（红色=错误，黄色=警告，绿色=成功）</li>\n<li>确认提示格式统一（<code>[y/N]</code> 大写表示默认选项）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"人机工程学评估工具\">人机工程学评估工具</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>clig.dev</strong> — Command Line Interface Guidelines，全面的 CLI 设计规范</li>\n<li><strong>oclif.io</strong> — Salesforce 的 CLI 框架，内置多种 UX 最佳实践</li>\n<li><strong>charm.sh</strong> — 美观的终端 UI 组件库（Go）</li>\n<li><strong>chalk/kleur</strong> — 终端颜色库（Node.js）</li>\n<li><strong>indicatif</strong> — 进度条库（Rust）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"设计灵感\">设计灵感</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>GitHub CLI (gh)</strong> — 上下文感知、交互式选择、优美的错误信息</li>\n<li><strong>Vercel CLI</strong> — 零配置即可部署、渐进式复杂度</li>\n<li><strong>Railway CLI</strong> — 链接项目后所有操作自动带上下文</li>\n<li><strong>pnpm</strong> — 清晰的包管理输出、快速的性能反馈</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>人机工程学是让工具从&quot;能用&quot;升级到&quot;好用&quot;的关键。技术上完美但用户体验糟糕的工具，最终会被技术上普通但体验优秀的工具取代。</p>\n<p>人机工程学核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>命名要直觉</strong>：用户不查文档也能猜到命令的含义</li>\n<li><strong>默认值要智能</strong>：零配置即可完成 80% 的常见场景</li>\n<li><strong>错误要可操作</strong>：告诉用户该怎么修复，而不只是说&quot;出错了&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度要分层</strong>：新手和专家各取所需，互不干扰</li>\n<li><strong>反馈要及时</strong>：进度条、成功确认、耗时统计</li>\n<li><strong>一致性优先</strong>：宁可所有地方都&quot;中等&quot;，也不要一些地方&quot;优秀&quot;一些地方&quot;糟糕&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"人机工程学","id":"人机工程学"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"人机工程学的五个维度","id":"人机工程学的五个维度"},{"level":3,"text":"命名的艺术","id":"命名的艺术"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进式复杂度暴露","id":"渐进式复杂度暴露"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"设计直觉的帮助系统","id":"设计直觉的帮助系统"},{"level":3,"text":"设计可操作的错误信息","id":"设计可操作的错误信息"},{"level":3,"text":"实现智能默认值","id":"实现智能默认值"},{"level":3,"text":"进度反馈设计","id":"进度反馈设计"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"确认步骤的设计","id":"确认步骤的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"自动补全","id":"自动补全"},{"level":3,"text":"一致性胜过完美","id":"一致性胜过完美"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"人机工程学评估工具","id":"人机工程学评估工具"},{"level":3,"text":"设计灵感","id":"设计灵感"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"可组合性设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/tool-design-principles/composability-design"},"next":{"title":"开源准备清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/open-source-your-tools/open-source-readiness-checklist"}}